  "description": "StockTok Weekly Wrap-Up",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Friday! We have had a great week in the markets yet again…today was a bit boring…but after the tumultuous TACO trades, it kind of makes sense. Everything you need to know is in this short 5 minute video, so no need to write a long winded article. </p><p>If you missed any of these highlights, be sure to check them out or save them for when you have a free moment:</p><ul><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/going-shopping-3-finance-stocks-im?r=4z8lgl\">3 Stocks I Bought This Week</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buy-alerts-triggered?r=4z8lgl\">2 Recent Buy Signals</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/unnecessary-stock-market-panic?r=4z8lgl\">Stop Panicking About The Market + Recession Resistant Assets are BEST</a></strong></p></li><li><p><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-203633422?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Melt-Up &amp; Melt-Down Update</a></strong></p></li></ul><p>You may want to watch the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">ETF Research Article</a> if me saying “StockTok ETF” is not making sense to you. </p><p>Lastly, if you are at all into Physical Media like me, <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Obsolete Media&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:139801746,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2794897d-77b3-451a-a5f3-c7492f77a062_454x462.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;1a2b0fd9-2aa3-426e-b955-baa264a7095d&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> has been a fun, growing group to be apart of. I see people sharing what they are watching on Friday’s, so check his page out if you are interested. I will be partaking in the original 1993 Super Mario Brothers movie. I am sure the graphics will be <em><strong>TOP TIER</strong></em>! LOL</p><p><strong>PLEASE LIKE</strong> ❤️, <strong>RE-STACK</strong> and <strong>SHARE</strong> this! It is the only way we can beat out the AI slop here on Substack! It only takes 2 seconds to do. </p><p>Have a great weekend…take time off away from the charts. It is so critical to come in Monday’s with a fresh mind and good attitude! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a> </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/you-may-have-missed-an-update/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/you-may-have-missed-an-update/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p>",
